             'Cengel Problem 17–20 (printed answer 3.73): CO₂ (k = 1.289; R = 0.1889; c_p = 0.846 kJ/(kg·K)) enters an adiabatic nozzle at 1200 K, 50 m/s and leaves at 400 K. The Mach number at the exit is:',
